l16-linux is licensed per folder; the full texts are in LICENSES/.

kernel/     GPL-2.0-only (LICENSES/GPL-2.0-only.txt): changes to the Linux kernel.
docs/       CC-BY-SA-4.0 (LICENSES/CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt), like the postmarketOS wiki.
Everything
else        MIT (LICENSES/MIT.txt): the packages, scripts, configuration and tools.

No firmware or other stock LightOS files are included.
